(7398954, 1163450, 163081, '<td valign="top">Thanks Paul, <br/>It''s weird to have gotten only 1 comment during voting time. <br/>The score was always in ribbon territory but went down in the last day. I wanted to create something that was like building up to the sky. I drove on the scooter for a half day, seeking the tall constructions in the city.</td>', 'Thanks Paul, It''s weird to have gotten only 1 comment during voting time. The score was always in ribbon territory but went down in the last day. I wanted to create something that was like building up to the sky. I drove on the scooter for a half day, seeking the tall constructions in the city.', '2015-08-21 09:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
